text:
toshi: quick UX note from today's console review: toolbar CTAs look slapped up against the search on small breakpoints. feels visually heavy.
marie: can you toss a screenshot? i think that's the compact spacing token at play.
toshi: screenshot: https://img.redwood.example/console-toolbar-narrow.png
devin: yep that's `--space-compact` at 6px. for buttons with icon+label, 10px gives better tap target rhythm.
jordan: instead of changing `--space-compact` broadly, what about introducing `--space-inline-component` or `--space-toolbar-gap` scoped to the toolbar so other compact areas don't widen?
marie: leaning toward `--space-toolbar-gap` too. low risk and clear intent.
toshi: agreed. also noticed modal dismiss on mobile isn't keyboard focusable when opened via toolbar -> launches modal -> ESC sometimes doesn't close on VoiceOver.
aria-bot: accessibility alert: modal dialog missing focus trap on iOS VoiceOver (detected in a11y smoke).
devin: sounds like our Modal component isn't applying focus to first tabbable element on open for some cases. quick patch suggestion:
```js
// modal open handler
modal.onOpen(() => {
  const focusTarget = modal.querySelector('[data-autofocus]') || modal.querySelector('button, a, input');
  if (focusTarget) focusTarget.focus();
  modal.setAttribute('role', 'dialog');
  modal.setAttribute('aria-modal', 'true');
});
```
marie: also add `data-autofocus` to the primary action in the job-run modal.
toshi: one more: toasts are dismissible but don't move focus to the toast on error. keyboard users might miss the retry button. propose error toasts get tabindex=0 and role=alert. success toasts stay polite.
jordan: agree. small copy nit: buttons say 'Run' in the toolbar but modal primary says 'Start job'. pick one verb. i'd vote 'Run job' for consistency.
marie: let's standardize on "Run job". I'm updating the copy tokens file.
toshi: next steps: devin to add `--space-toolbar-gap: 10px` token + storybook example at 320px width; devin to patch Modal focus trap and add aria-modal; devin to make error toasts tabbable and role=alert; marie to update copy tokens. i'll open a tracking PR and link it here. :seedling:
aria-bot: design token changes pushed to Figma (file: Console Tokens) — https://figma.redwood.example/file/console-tokens
marie: thanks all, appreciate the quick sync. i'll watch the PR and run a11y pass after changes land.
